# The data files ship beside the DLL and their hashes are built into it, so their bytes must not depend on the
# platform that checks them out. Fixing the line endings keeps the build deterministic across machines.
* text=auto
*.cs text eol=crlf
*.csproj text eol=crlf
*.csv text eol=crlf
*.json text eol=crlf
*.xml text eol=crlf
*.md text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
